datastore-go-mock

Fork of github.com/hanzoai/clickhouse-go-mock (itself derived from
SigNoz/clickhouse-go-mock and ClickHouse/clickhouse-go), renamed for the
Hanzo datastore debrand. Licensed under Apache-2.0; original copyrights
retained (see LICENSE). The module mocks the Hanzo datastore driver
(github.com/hanzoai/datastore-go), which speaks the ClickHouse SQL wire
protocol; upstream wire types (github.com/ClickHouse/ch-go) are used as-is.
